SUMMARY: New Exhibitions at the Brown County Art Guild
DESCRIPTION:New Exhibitions at the Brown County Art Guild!\n\nJuly 24 – N
 ovember 7\, 2026\n\nGuild Artist Exhibition and Sale\n\nSummer brings fre
 sh inspiration\, and our Guild Artists have been busy creating new work t
 o share. Discover new landscapes\, still lifes\, contemporary works\, and
  more as you explore the Guild Galleries. Whether you're an avid collecto
 r\, art enthusiast\, or simply looking for inspiration\, this exhibition 
 offers a wonderful opportunity to experience the creativity that continue
 s to thrive in Brown County.\n\nJuly 24 – November 7\, 2026\n\nThe Art of
  Brown County – Scenes & Views\n\nSpecial Exhibition & Sale\n\nThe Art of
  Brown County – Scenes & Views is a special exhibition and sale that cele
 brates the familiar vistas\, treasured locations\, and fresh perspectives
  that honor both the natural beauty and rich artistic heritage of the are
 a.\n\nFind the places you love reflected in original works by the artists
  of the Brown County Art Guild. Every painting tells a story of Brown Cou
 nty & Nashville\, Indiana with color\, light and texture.\n\n------------
 ------------------------------------------------------------------------\
 n\nBrown County Art Guild – A not for profit organization located in the 
 heart of downtown Nashville\, Indiana. On display throughout its gallerie
 s is a prized collection of historic paintings as well as current works f
 or sale from regional award-winning member artists. The Guild also offers
  artist demonstrations\, workshops\, and a variety of events and programs
  throughout the year.\n\nMarch – December: Monday–Saturday\, 11 – 5 and S
 unday\, 12 – 4\n\nWINTER HOURS: January – February: Thursday – Saturday 1
 1 – 5 and Sunday 12-4 or by appointment.\n\nFor more information\, please
  call the Guild at 812-988-6185 or visit our website: browncountyartguild
 .org/ https://browncountyartguild.org/
CATEGORIES:Exhibition,Free,Gallery,Nashville
