SUMMARY: "Above the Real: A Collection of Wearable Art" by Jane Matranga
DESCRIPTION:We're thrilled to present an exhibition by local artist Jane 
 Matranga — a body of work that blurs the line between what we hang on a w
 all and what we wear on our bodies.\n\nHer pieces are wearable\, tangible
 \, and full of movement and personality. It's the kind of show that makes
  you rethink what "art" even means.\n\n  * Location: Arts Alliance Center
 \, College Mall\n  * Dates: Monday\, October 6 – Saturday\, November 1\n\
 nTo celebrate\, we're throwing a special reception that's part gallery op
 ening\, part fashion show.\n\nReception & Runway Show:\n\n  * Date: Satur
 day\, October 10\n  * Time: 5–7 PM (reception) | 6 PM (runway show begins
 )\n  * What to expect: Models walking the runway in Matranga's wearable a
 rt\, bringing her pieces to life in a way a static display just can't\n\n
 Come mingle\, meet the artist\, and explore her work. Whether you're a lo
 ngtime art lover or just curious to see something unexpected\, this is on
 e exhibition you won't want to miss.
CATEGORIES:Bloomington,Exhibition,Free,In-Person,Visual-Arts
