SUMMARY: It Was Just An Accident | Arthouse Now
DESCRIPTION:Mechanic Vahid is jarringly reminded of his time in an Irania
 n prison for being branded a "dissident" when he has a chance encounter w
 ith Eghbal\, a man he strongly suspects to be his sadistic jailhouse capt
 or. Panicked\, Vahid rounds up some of his fellow ex-prisoners to try and
  confirm Eghbal's identity and determine what to do next. Panahi creates 
 a deeply felt moral thriller\, combining high stakes tension with unexpec
 ted humor and thoughtful\, yet devastating\, questions regarding persecut
 ion and revenge. [103 min\; thriller\, drama\; Persian with English subti
 tles]
