SUMMARY: Tale Blazing by MDWST Fable
DESCRIPTION:Join us for this year's edition of Tale Blazing\, when you'll
  hear five stories around five fires in the nighttime woods\n\nMDWST Fabl
 e and The Hundredth Hill present an evening of storytelling in an atmosph
 ere as old as humanity: around a crackling fire in the dark woods. Design
 ed to shift our listening and change our approach to stories\, Tale Blazi
 ng will bring together five unconventional storytellers exploring what it
  means to keep our light shining\, even when all seems dark. Listen to ta
 les\, wander together\, and then end the night with friendship and snacks
 .\n\nLearn more and buy tickets here https://www.eventbrite.com/e/tale-bl
 azing-an-evening-of-fireside-storytelling-tickets-1996466367649 .
CATEGORIES:
