SUMMARY: IU Cinema Creative Collaborations Meet & Mix | Additional Films 
 and Guests
DESCRIPTION:Be a part of making film for all possible! Join us for our an
 nual Meet & Mix at The Vault Pub to explore our Creative Collaborations p
 rogram opportunities. Space limited\, R.S.V.P. required.\n\n\nAbout IU Ci
 nema Creative Collaborations Meet & Mix\n\nIf you are interested in apply
 ing for our next round of Creative Collaborations\, taking place in 2027–
 28\, this is the session for you! Learn more about the program\, meet pot
 ential programming partners\, and enjoy tasty hors d’oeuvres at The Vault
  Pub.\n\nCreative Collaborations enables groups at IU and in our communit
 y to highlight important topics and ideas through film screenings and fil
 m-related educational programs. The mission of Creative Collaborations is
  to:\n\n  * Foster diverse programming partnerships that help bridge camp
 us and community\n  * Highlight critical issues and themes through film-r
 elated and educational programs curated in collaboration with IU Cinema a
 nd subject-matter experts\n  * Welcome new and returning audiences to IU 
 Cinema\n\nApplications for 2027–28 program proposals will be accepted fro
 m October 8–November 20\, 2026. Full program guidelines are available at 
 go.iu.edu/creativecollaborations https://cinema.indiana.edu/about/partner
 ships/creative-collaborations.html .\n\nSpace for this Meet & Mix is limi
 ted. R.S.V.P. required. https://events.iu.edu/cinemaiub/event/2381056-iu-
 cinema-creative-collaborations-meet-mix\n\nPast Partner Tip #1: "Be speci
 fic in your focus\, build coalitions of support\, and have speakers that 
 inspire attendance."\n\nPast Partner Tip #2: "Select a topic that appeals
  to campus stakeholders\, make sure the event is well publicized\, and in
 tegrate the series with courses."\n\nPast Partner Tip #3: "I found the pr
 ocess to be relatively simple\, so I would encourage people to take the r
 isk. The staff at IU Cinema is a pleasure to work with."
CATEGORIES:Free
