SUMMARY: Hocus Pocus | CINEKid's International Children's Film Series\, J
 orgensen Guest Filmmaker Series\, Doug Jones: Of Monsters and Men
DESCRIPTION:You're in for a devil of a time when three outlandishly wild 
 witches—the Sanderson Sisters portrayed by Bette Midler\, Sarah Jessica P
 arker\, and Kathy Najimy—return from 17th-century Salem after they're acc
 identally conjured up by some unsuspecting pranksters. The 300-year-old t
 rio set out to terrorize the town\, but first they must get their act tog
 ether and outwit three kids and a talking cat! Co-starring Doug Jones\, w
 ho transforms into the good-natured zombie ex-boyfriend of Winifred Sande
 rson\, William "Billy" Butcherson. [96 min\; comedy\, fantasy\; English]
CATEGORIES:
