SUMMARY: A Harvest of Voices
DESCRIPTION:A Harvest of Voices 2026\n\nJoin us to celebrate the words an
 d voices of writers from Women Writing for (a) Change Bloomington circles
 . The event features acclaimed author Jacinda Townsend\, whose award-winn
 ing work includes Mother Country and Trigger Warning. In addition\, we'll
  lift up the voices of writers from our in-house and outreach creative wr
 iting circles.\n\nMeet Jacinda and our readers while enjoying community a
 t a reception following the program. Please gather with us at the UU Chur
 ch of Bloomington to bring in our 2026 Harvest of Voices!\n\nThe mission 
 of Women Writing for (a) Change Bloomington is to create safe and inspiri
 ng learning opportunities for individuals who wish to pursue the art of w
 riting as a tool for growth and change. We believe in the power of writin
 g to connect people to the deeper parts of themselves and to one another.
  We believe that creative and conscious communities hold the key to posit
 ive transformation in our world. We provide an attentive setting in which
  every voice is honored\, nurtured\, and celebrated.\n\nThank you for sup
 porting our work!
CATEGORIES:Literary-Arts,In-Person,Bloomington
