SUMMARY: OnRamp Creative Entrepreneur Accelerator: Applications Open
DESCRIPTION:On-Ramp Creative Entrepreneur Accelerator: Southern Indiana\n
 April 19-21\, 2027\n\nPillar Arts and the Indiana University Center for R
 ural Engagement are partnering with the Indiana Arts Commission to host t
 he On-Ramp Creative Entrepreneur Accelerator for the southern Indiana reg
 ion. This three-day intensive entrepreneurship and community engagement w
 orkshop helps Indiana creative entrepreneurs build a sustainable practice
  through a portfolio career model. Participants also have the chance to a
 pply for up to $2\,000 to put what they learn into action.\n\nThe deadlin
 e to apply is January 15\, 2027\, at 4:30 PM ET. An informational webinar
  will be held November 10\, 2026\, at 6:00 PM ET. Register for the webina
 r https://www.zoomgov.com/webinar/register/WN_DBQ7HHY5RAWm5hZV5OVMfQ or l
 earn more and apply https://www.in.gov/arts/programs-and-services/trainin
 g/on-ramp-creative-entrepreneur-accelerator/ .
CATEGORIES:Bloomington,Class,Educators,In-Person
