SUMMARY: BEAT 15th Anniversary Fall Show
DESCRIPTION:Bloomington Expressive Arts Training: BEAT will present their
  15th Anniversary BEAT Fall Show on Monday\, October 26th at 7PM at the B
 uskirk-Chumley Theater. BEAT is a pre professional\, community show choir
  program for children in grades 1-12 throughout Bloomington and surroundi
 ng areas. Come watch our members of Mini Sync\, Syncopation & Amplitude s
 ing and dance their hearts out! BEAT invites you to partake in the innova
 tive\, engaging entertainment fit for the whole family!! Come get to know
  these incredibly talented young people and help us celebrate 15 years of
  music\, laughter and love!
