SUMMARY: Appetizers & Opportunities with CDFI Friendly
DESCRIPTION:CDFI Friendly Bloomington’s Board of Directors invites you to
  its annual event\, bringing together residents\, advocates\, and regiona
 l community development partners to explore the role of Community Develop
 ment Financial Institution (CDFI) investment in our region. Come network\
 , celebrate CFB’s impact\, learn about its growth\, and meet CDFI and com
 munity development partners.\n\nThe program begins at 4:00 pm with two pa
 nel discussions and regional community development highlights. “Small Bus
 iness\, Big Impact” looks under the hood of small business lending\, shar
 ing resources and best practices for entrepreneurs across the Indiana Upl
 ands and CFB region. “Affordability in Real Time” goes beyond housing to 
 discuss community development lending and the everyday economic challenge
 s and opportunities our neighbors face.\n\nA networking reception follows
  at 5:30 pm.\n\nPlease RSVP by October 23. Questions? Contact John Zody a
 t john@cdfifriendlybtown.org mailto:john@cdfifriendlybtown.org .
CATEGORIES:
