SUMMARY: IU Cinema Creative Collaborations Zoom Q&A | Additional Films an
 d Guests
DESCRIPTION:Thinking about applying for our next round of Creative Collab
 orations in 2027–28? Get hands-on application help from IU Cinema staff a
 nd be a part of making film for all possible!\n\n\nAbout IU Cinema Creati
 ve Collaborations Zoom Q&A + Prep Session\n\nRegistrants for this Q&A + p
 rep session will be able to speak with IU Cinema staff members regarding 
 any questions related to the Creative Collaborations application process.
 \n\nCreative Collaborations enables groups at IU and in our community to 
 highlight important topics and ideas through film screenings and film-rel
 ated educational programs with a mission of:\n\n  * Fostering diverse pro
 gramming partnerships that help bridge campus and community\n  * Highligh
 ting critical issues and themes through film-related and educational prog
 rams curated in collaboration with IU Cinema and subject-matter experts\n
   * Welcoming new and returning audiences to IU Cinema\n\nCreative Collab
 orations is a competitive application process\, and any IU Bloomington un
 it\, student group\, Greater-Bloomington community groups or non-profit o
 rganization is welcome to apply. Explore some of our previous Creative Co
 llaborations programming https://cinema.indiana.edu/about/partnerships/cr
 eative-collaborations-past-programming.html to get an idea of what past p
 artners have presented.\n\nApplications for 2027–28 program proposals wil
 l be accepted from October 8–November 20\, 2026.\n\nFull program guidelin
 es are available at go.iu.edu/creativecollaborations https://cinema.india
 na.edu/about/partnerships/creative-collaborations.html . You can register
  here https://iu.zoom.us/meeting/register/Wr70_5MHT_OO4ZCtlu6ufQ#/registr
 ation for this Zoom Q&A and prep session!
CATEGORIES:Free
