SUMMARY: AMP Bloomington 2026
DESCRIPTION:AMP Bloomington is a three-day\, Homecoming-week event that b
 rings Bloomington’s founders\, investors\, employers\, students\, univers
 ity leaders\, and community partners into the same rooms on purpose\, so 
 everyone building the city can connect in one place.\n\nDay 1 opens at th
 e Buskirk-Chumley Theater with a keynote from Sweetwater CEO Mike Clem on
  growing a national retailer from Indiana. Featured speakers include Bria
 n Kelsey of Heartland Forward\, Katherine Pease of Pathstone\, Polina Osh
 erov of Pattern\, and IU faculty Tatiana Kolovou\, Isak Nti Asare\, and D
 avid Wild\, with more still to be announced.\n\nWhen you register\, tell 
 organizers who you want to meet\, so you leave with a real next step. Att
 endance is free and includes a coworking day pass at The Mill\, and stude
 nts are especially encouraged to come.\n\nLearn more and register at: htt
 ps://amplifybloomington.org/amp-bloomington/ https://amplifybloomington.o
 rg/amp-bloomington/
