DESCRIPTION:Return to Bloomington for Indiana University’s 2026 Homecomin
 g weekend! Reconnect with old friends\, revisit campus traditions\, and s
 how your Hoosier pride as alumni\, students\, and fans come together to c
 elebrate IU.\n\nThe weekend’s festivities include the annual Homecoming P
 arade on Friday\, October 30\, along with activities across campus and th
 roughout Bloomington. Whether you’re returning to campus or celebrating a
 s a longtime fan\, Homecoming is a chance to enjoy the community and trad
 itions that make IU special.
