SUMMARY: Postmodern Panic: Meta-Horror Double Feature with Scream + Cabin
  in the Woods | Friday Night Frights
DESCRIPTION:Scream (Wes Craven\, USA\, 1996): The horror blockbuster that
  jumpstarted a franchise that is still going strong\, Scream follows a se
 ries of mysterious deaths in a small town as an offbeat group of friends 
 become the target of a masked killer. As the body count rises\, the kids 
 must learn "the rules" of horror films to survive. [111 min\; horror\; En
 glish]\n\nCabin in the Woods (Drew Goddard\, USA\, 2011): When five colle
 ge friends arrive at a remote forest vacation cabin\, little do they expe
 ct the horrors that await them. One by one\, they fall victim to backwood
 s zombies\, soon discovering that there is more going on than meets the e
 ye. [95 min\; horror\; English]
