SUMMARY: The Exorcist (1973)
DESCRIPTION:One of the most iconic horror movies ever made\, this tale of
  an exorcism is based loosely on actual events.\nA HALLOWEEN MUST SEE!\n\
 nWhen young Regan (Linda Blair) starts acting odd — levitating\, speaking
  in tongues — her worried mother (Ellen Burstyn) seeks medical help\, onl
 y to hit a dead end.\n\nA local priest (Jason Miller)\, however\, thinks 
 the girl may be seized by the devil.\n\nThe priest makes a request to per
 form an exorcism\, and the church sends in an expert (Max von Sydow) to h
 elp with the difficult job.\n\nLENGTH: 2hr 2mins\nFORMAT: DCP\nRATED: R
