SUMMARY: Mad Bills to Pay w/ Q&A | New Americas Cinema
DESCRIPTION:In a tight-knit Dominican American community in The Bronx\, R
 ico (Juan Collado) is hustling his way through the summer\, selling bootl
 eg "nutcracker" cocktails out of a beach cooler and chasing girls without
  a care in the world. But when his teenage girlfriend\, Destiny (Destiny 
 Checo)\, begins crashing at his place with his family\, turning their sma
 ll apartment into a stage for their messy\, complicated young love\, it’s
  only a matter of time before they’re hit with the sobering reality of gr
 owing up too fast in a city that waits for no one. Writer-director Joel A
 lfonso Vargas turns his hometown into the heartbeat of his debut feature\
 , teaming up with street-cast talent Collado and Checo\, to deliver a raw
  and deeply authentic look at life in The Bronx. [101 min\; comedy\, dram
 a\; English and Spanish with English subtitles]\n\nA Q&A with filmmaker J
 oel Alfonso Vargas will follow the screening.
CATEGORIES:Free
