SUMMARY: Sounds From the Black Hole featuring Tim Kaiser
DESCRIPTION:Tim Kaiser returns to Bloomington\, "taking a hammer to melod
 y and rhythm and pounding them into texture." Tim is the Dr. Frankenstein
  of noise\, resurrecting retired bodies with new circuitry\, inciting new
  resonances within them. Artifacts of the past become the music of the fu
 ture. If you are curious and in search of sound yourself\, you may even b
 e able to go home with a piece of his work.\n\nThe Black Hole House Band 
 is expanding to a possible sextet (or beyond!) with faces both familiar a
 nd new\, plus special guests Justin Clifford Rhody and Abigail Smith\, fo
 rmer Bloomingtonians living now in New Mexico. The House Band will play a
 n early and a late set.
