SUMMARY: No No Nooky T.V. + Nitrate Kisses | Underground Film Series
DESCRIPTION:No No Nooky T.V. (1987): No No Nooky T.V. confronts the femin
 ist controversy around sexuality with electronic language\, pixels\, and 
 interface. Even the monitor is eroticized in this film/video hybrid that 
 points fun at romance\, sexuality\, and love in our post-industrial age. 
 [12 min\; experimental\; English]\n\nNitrate Kisses (1992): Barbara Hamme
 r’s documentary Nitrate Kisses confronts the historical erasure of queer 
 sexuality through the frank embrace of sex as an act that is both liberat
 ing and political. [67 min\; English]
CATEGORIES:Free
