SUMMARY: Science of Art: Stitched & Salvaged with Discardia
DESCRIPTION:WonderLab's Science of Art series is teaming up with Discardi
 a\, a project of the Center for Sustainable Living\, for something a litt
 le different: Science of Art: Stitched & Salvaged.\n\nTurns out mending i
 s basically a science experiment in disguise. Drop in and get hands-on wi
 th the math\, materials\, and hidden creativity behind fixing what's torn
 \, worn\, or written off too soon — and discover how a needle and thread 
 can be surprisingly powerful tools for building a more sustainable world.
