SUMMARY: Goosebumps The Musical: Phantom of the Auditorium
DESCRIPTION:Constellation Stage & Screen presents “Goosebumps The Musical
 : Phantom of the Auditorium” on stage October 30th- November 15th at the 
 Waldron Auditorium.\n\nGet ready for a frightfully fun adventure with Goo
 sebumps The Musical\, based on the wildly popular books by R. L. Stine! W
 hen Brooke and Zeke are cast in their school’s spooky new play\, The Phan
 tom\, they start to wonder if the show is actually cursed. As strange mes
 sages appear and rehearsals are disrupted by a mysterious masked figure\,
  they must uncover the truth: is it all an elaborate prank… or is their t
 heater truly haunted? Full of catchy songs\, laugh-out-loud moments\, and
  just the right amount of Halloween-season chills\, this musical mystery 
 is perfect for kids\, tweens\, and grown-ups who remember reading by flas
 hlight. Fun for all ages!\n\nSee Constellation’s website for more informa
 tion\, including a detailed performance schedule. Learn more and find tic
 kets at seeconstellation.org/kids/goosebumps/ https://seeconstellation.or
 g/kids/goosebumps/
