SUMMARY: Off Night Cabaret: Leading Ladies of Broadway
DESCRIPTION:Broadway runs on divas—and we’re here for it!\n\nFrom golden-
 age icons to today’s powerhouse voices\, Leading Ladies of Broadway celeb
 rates the women who have defined the stage. Divas\, ingénues\, trailblaze
 rs\, and scene-stealers alike will belt the roof off\, make you laugh\, a
 nd break your heart.\n\nThis unforgettable evening of music shines a spot
 light on not only their songs\, but also the resilience\, glamour\, spiri
 t and wide-ranging identities of the women who’ve made Broadway legendary
 .
