 ey Rose\, an 18-year-old singer-songwriter blending poetic storytelling w
 ith a cinematic pop sound. On November 15\, to celebrate her golden eight
 eenth birthday (Oct 18th)\, Audrey takes the Buskirk-Chumley stage for he
 r first ticketed hometown concert\, sharing full-band originals and reima
 gined covers\, intimate acoustic moments\, and the stories behind the son
 gs. Come for the music\, step into her world\, and maybe find a little pi
 ece of yourself there\, too.
