SUMMARY: IU Latin Jazz Ensemble
DESCRIPTION:Join the Indiana University Latin Jazz Ensemble in honoring t
 he musical legacies of John Coltrane and Miles Davis on their centennial 
 anniversary.\n\nWith special guest artists trumpeter Ingrid Jensen and sa
 xophonist Imanuel Wilkins\, the ensemble will be performing their classic
  songs with an Afro-Caribbean twist.\n\n\nIt will be a fun-filled\, high 
 energy evening as we celebrate the music of these 20th century icons.\n\n
 The Indiana University Latin Jazz Ensemble is a 25-piece ensemble led by 
 trombonist Wayne Wallace and rhythm section coach Andy Miller. Bring your
  dancing shoes!\n\n\nThis event is FREE. No tickets are needed.
