DESCRIPTION:Pierce Arrow LIVE in Concert brings the powerhouse vocals\, t
 ight harmonies\, high-energy performances\, and signature variety that ha
 ve made Pierce Arrow a Branson favorite for years. Featuring a dynamic mi
 x of country\, rock\, gospel\, and audience favorites\, the show delivers
  nonstop entertainment from beginning to end.\n\nFor this special Decembe
 r performance\, Pierce Arrow also brings the spirit of the season to the 
 stage\, with the second half featuring Christmas favorites woven into the
  show for a festive finish. It’s the full Pierce Arrow concert experience
  audiences know and love\, with an extra dose of Christmas energy perfect
  for the holiday season.
