SUMMARY: The Children's Nutcracker
DESCRIPTION:Join MotionArts Dance Academy’s dancers for Bloomington’s own
  Children’s Nutcracker—a delightful holiday tradition danced by children\
 , for children and families!\n\nIn this enchanting\, slightly abridged ve
 rsion of the beloved Nutcracker Ballet\, Clara’s Christmas takes a magica
 l turn when she receives an extraordinary gift from her wonderfully quirk
 y uncle: a Nutcracker doll! As the clock strikes midnight\, Clara is swep
 t into a world of holiday wonder\, where she and her brave Nutcracker bat
 tle the mischievous Mouse King\, journey through a glistening winter wond
 erland of dancing snowflakes\, and discover the spectacular Land of the S
 weets. There\, the Sugar Plum Fairy reigns over a dazzling celebration of
  sweets and delights\, brought to life by her international courtiers.\n\
 nBut is it truly the magic of the Nutcracker that carries Clara on this e
 xtraordinary adventure… or is it all just a dream?\n\n\nUse code CHILD to
  recieve a $4 discount on tickets for children 6 and under. Code can be a
 pplied to 1 ticket per transaction. Children 2 and younder who do not nee
 d their own seat do not need a ticket.
CATEGORIES:Bloomington,In-Person,Dance,Tickets
