SUMMARY: Annie
DESCRIPTION:Constellation Stage & Screen presents “Annie” on stage Decemb
 er 10th - January 3rd at the Waldron Auditorium.\n\nDiscover the magic of
  Annie\, the iconic Broadway musical that has captured hearts for generat
 ions! The timeless tale of Little Orphan Annie follows a tenacious young 
 girl whose unbreakable optimism leads her on an unforgettable journey fro
 m a New York City orphanage to a place she can finally call home. Featuri
 ng one of Broadway’s most memorable scores\, including “It’s the Hard-Kno
 ck Life\,” “Easy Street\,” “N.Y.C.” and the endlessly-uplifting “Tomorrow
 \,” Annie is a delightful theatrical experience for the entire family. Fu
 n for all ages!\n\nSee Constellation’s website for more information\, inc
 luding a detailed performance schedule. Learn more and find tickets at se
 econstellation.org/kids/annie/ https://seeconstellation.org/kids/annie/
