 m-7pm for a festive filled afternoon of warm brews and holiday delights.\
 n\nIn collaboration with A Cup of Leaves and Books\, we'll be offering co
 mplimentary warm beverages and tasty treats all day.\n\nFestive Tea & Tre
 ats\nEnjoy warm seasonal brews and holiday bites while you mingle.\n\nLoc
 ally Made Holiday Gifts\nBrowse curated wellness products\, teas\, gift s
 ets\, photo prints\, greeting cards\, calendars\, and more.\n100% locally
  made.\n\nWalk-In Photo Mini-Sessions\nHoliday themed portraits delivered
  same day.\nPrints and greeting card options available with quick turnaro
 und before the holidays.\n\nNo RSVP necessary.
