SUMMARY: Stand By Me | Escape the Week Mega Marathon
DESCRIPTION:In a small woodsy Oregon town\, a group of childhood friends—
 sensitive Gordie (Wil Wheaton)\, tough guy Chris (River Phoenix)\, flambo
 yant Teddy (Corey Feldman)\, and scaredy-cat Vern (Jerry O'Connell)—are i
 n search of a missing teenager's body. Wanting to be heroes in each other
 's and their hometown's eyes\, they set out on an unforgettable two-day t
 rek that turns into an odyssey of self-discovery. They sneak smokes\, tel
 l tall tales\, cuss 'cause it's cool\, and band together when the going g
 ets tough. When they encounter the town's knife-wielding hoods who are al
 so after the body\, the boys discover a strength they never knew they had
 . Filled with humor and suspense and based on the novella The Body by Ste
 phen King\, Stand By Me is a rare and special film about friendship and t
 he indelible experiences of growing up. [89 min\; adventure\, drama\; Eng
 lish]
CATEGORIES:Free
