SUMMARY: The Life of Chuck | Escape the Week Mega Marathon
DESCRIPTION:As the world unravels\, Charles “Chuck” Krantz’s life is reca
 lled in three acts\, capturing joy\, loss\, and the quiet moments that ma
 ke a life feel full. The Life of Chuck is a genre-defying exploration of 
 what it means to truly be alive and have your life changed—in ways big an
 d small—through the cast of characters you assemble throughout your lifet
 ime. Tom Hiddleston anchors an extraordinary ensemble cast—including Matt
 hew Lillard\, Chiwetel Ejiofor\, Mark Hamill\, Jacob Tremblay\, and Mia S
 ara—in this Stephen King adaptation by Mike Flanagan that took home Peopl
 e's Choice Award honors at the Toronto International Film Festival. [111 
 min\; drama\, fantasy\, sci-fi\; English]
