SUMMARY: Misery | Escape the Week Mega Marathon
DESCRIPTION:Angry that he had the audacity to kill off the hero of one of
  her favorite books\, a lonely woman hobbles and holds her favorite novel
 ist hostage\, giving him no choice but to write a new book\, exactly the 
 way she wants it—and she's not going to let him go until it's complete. F
 or his original novella\, King based the character of the unstable fan\, 
 Annie\, on Mark David Chapman\, who at some point before murdering John L
 ennon met King and asked for an autograph\, introducing himself as King's
  "number one fan." Misery features a stellar supporting cast\, including 
 Hollywood legends Richard Farnsworth and Lauren Bacall. Kathy Bates recei
 ved a Best Actress Oscar win for her role as the lonely and depraved Anni
 e. [107 min\; thriller\, drama\; English]
