SUMMARY: It | Escape the Week Mega Marathon
DESCRIPTION:In Derry\, Maine\, seven young friends unite against a terrif
 ying supernatural creature that has been haunting their small town for ce
 nturies. Calling itself Pennywise the Dancing Clown\, It is a monster of 
 unspeakable power\, taking the form of everyone's most horrific fears. Th
 reatened by their worst nightmares\, the only way these kids can survive 
 It is together. Originally adapted from King's 1986 novel as a 1990 minis
 eries featuring Tim Curry in the terrifying titular role\, this modern up
 date launched a film franchise creating nightmare fuel for generations to
  come. [135 min\; horror\, drama\; English and Hebrew with English subtit
 les]
CATEGORIES:Free
