SUMMARY: WonderLab New Year's Eve 2026
DESCRIPTION:Ring in the New Year the WonderLab way — with an early countd
 own made just for kids!\n\nGet ready to glow. Explore all things that shi
 ne\, sparkle\, and light up\, and uncover the science behind the shine. L
 et the kids get their wiggles out with dancing\, games\, and a countdown 
 of their very own — so by the time the ball drops for the grown-ups\, the
 y're happily worn out and ready for bed.
