 06428328ed/6af5dca033339b9bfd53254a/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Direct from Off-Broadway and London’s West End\, the
  internationally acclaimed A Taste of Ireland Company comes to the USA wi
 th its flagship production — ‘A...
X-TKF-PROMOTION-BUTTON;label=Buy Tickets!;skip_details=false:https://busk
 irkchumley.org/events/a-taste-of-ireland-june-9-2027/#buy
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, 114 East Kirkwood Avenue\, Bloomington
 \, IN 47408\, USA
